<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Guidance Credibility — {{asset_name}}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Lora:wght@500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root{--ink:#1c1c1a;--muted:#6c6c68;--faint:#9a9a96;--line:#e8e7e3;--line2:#f0efeb;--card:#fafaf8;--bg:#fff;--green:#1c7a4d;--green-d:#155f3c;--green-bg:#eef5f0;--green-bd:#cfe5d8;--red:#bb3a32;--red-d:#9a2d27;--red-bg:#fbeeed;--red-bd:#f0d4d1;--amber:#b1750f;--amber-d:#8f5d0a;--amber-bg:#fbf3e3;--amber-bd:#ecd9b5;--blue:#4f6ef7;--blue-bg:#eef0ff;--radius:10px;--qci-accent:#4f6ef7;--qci-accent-bg:#f0f2ff;--qci-accent-bd:#d0d8fd;--qci-accent-dark:#3652d9;--qci-glow:rgba(79,110,247,.12);--qci-rising:#1c7a4d;--qci-rising-bg:#eef5f0;--qci-new:#4f6ef7;--qci-new-bg:#eef0ff;--qci-steady:#6c6c68;--qci-steady-bg:#f0efeb;--qci-watch:#a86e0e;--qci-watch-bg:#fbf2e2}
    *{box-sizing:border-box} body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:15px/1.55 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}.serif,.big,.score-num,.qci-header-title,.qci-signal-count,.wname{font-family:Lora,Georgia,serif}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:34px 40px 64px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:20px}.lens-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.eyebrow,.sec-title{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint)}.title{font-size:36px;line-height:1.2;margin:18px 0 0}.xbtn{width:38px;height:38px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:#fff;color:var(--faint);font-size:20px}.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 11px;border:1px solid;border-radius:6px;white-space:nowrap}.strong,.inline,.achieved,.reaffirmed{color:var(--green-d);background:var(--green-bg);border-color:var(--green-bd)}.moderate,.track,.tracking,.unresolved{color:var(--amber-d);background:var(--amber-bg);border-color:var(--amber-bd)}.low,.miss,.missed{color:var(--red-d);background:var(--red-bg);border-color:var(--red-bd)}.revised{color:#3652d9;background:#eef0ff;border-color:#d0d8fd}.discontinued,.unclear{color:#666;background:#f0efeb;border-color:#deddd8}.score-badge{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-top:22px}.score-ring{position:relative;width:72px;height:72px;flex:0 0 auto}.score-ring svg{display:block}.score-num{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:600}.score-label{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.score-desc{max-width:780px;margin-top:5px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5}.c-green{color:var(--green-d)}.c-red{color:var(--red-d)}.c-amber{color:var(--amber-d)}.sec{margin-top:42px}.sec-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:20px;margin-bottom:16px}.sec-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);text-align:right}.trio{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(var(--count),1fr);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--card);overflow:hidden}.stat{padding:24px 26px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.stat:last-child{border:0}.lab{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%}.g{color:var(--green-d)}.dot.g{background:var(--green)}.r{color:var(--red-d)}.dot.r{background:var(--red)}.a{color:var(--amber-d)}.dot.a{background:var(--amber)}.big{font-size:27px;line-height:1.18;font-weight:600;margin:15px 0 10px}.desc{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted)}
    .qci-section{margin-top:48px;border:1px solid var(--qci-accent-bd);border-radius:14px;background:#fcfcff;overflow:hidden}.qci-header{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:28px 32px 24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1f3a,#2a3060)}.qci-header:before,.qci-header:after{content:"";position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(139,164,251,.07)}.qci-header:before{width:200px;height:200px;right:-40px;top:-65px}.qci-header:after{width:300px;height:150px;left:-100px;bottom:-100px}.qci-signal-count{position:absolute;right:32px;top:23px;color:#8ba4fb;font-size:32px;text-align:right}.qci-signal-count small{display:block;font:600 10px Inter;letter-spacing:.09em}.qci-badge{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:5px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(139,164,251,.35);border-radius:99px;color:#a9bafa;background:rgba(79,110,247,.12);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.qci-badge-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#8ba4fb;animation:qcipulse 2s infinite}@keyframes qcipulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(139,164,251,.12)}}.qci-header-title{position:relative;margin-top:20px;color:#fff;font-size:26px}.qci-header-sub{position:relative;max-width:720px;margin-top:6px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.58);font-size:13.5px}.qci-header-sub strong{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)}.qci-table,.tbl{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.qci-table th,.qci-table td,.tbl th,.tbl td{text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px 20px}.qci-table th,.tbl th{padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px;background:#f7f7fb;color:var(--faint);font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.qci-table tbody tr:hover{background:#f8f8ff}.theme-name,.m-name{font-weight:600}.theme-sub,.m-desc{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:3px}.spark{width:110px;height:46px}.qci-status-pill{display:inline-flex;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 11px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}.qci-status-pill.new{color:var(--qci-new);background:var(--qci-new-bg)}.qci-status-pill.rising{color:var(--qci-rising);background:var(--qci-rising-bg)}.qci-status-pill.steady{color:var(--qci-steady);background:var(--qci-steady-bg)}.qci-status-pill.mixed{color:var(--qci-watch);background:var(--qci-watch-bg)}.qci-sources{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:14px 20px;background:#f7f7fb;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;color:var(--faint);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.qci-src-pill{padding:4px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;background:#fff;color:var(--muted)}.qci-edge{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;gap:20px;padding:22px 28px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#1a1f3a,#202660);color:rgba(255,255,255,.85)}.qci-edge-label{color:#8ba4fb;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.qci-edge-text{font-size:14.5px}.qci-edge-text p{margin:0 0 8px}.qci-edge-text p:last-child{margin:0}.hl{color:#9fb1ff}.hl2{color:#82dfc4}.hl3{color:#c7a9ff}.pct{color:#f0c66c}
    .scatter,.tbl-card,.split{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--card);overflow:hidden}.scatter{padding:18px 22px}.chart{width:100%;height:auto;min-width:680px}.chart-scroll{overflow-x:auto}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 22px;padding:12px 2px 0;color:var(--faint);font-size:11px}.legend b{font-size:14px}.tbl-card{overflow-x:auto}.tbl{min-width:900px}.tbl td{font-size:13px}.metric{position:relative}.metric:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:14px;bottom:14px;width:3px;border-radius:3px}.metric.positive:before{background:var(--green)}.metric.negative:before{background:var(--red)}.metric.neutral:before{background:var(--amber)}.metric.unknown:before{background:var(--faint)}.src-btn{margin-top:7px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;color:var(--amber-d);cursor:pointer;font:600 11.5px Inter}.src-row td{padding:0!important}.src-inner{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .28s}.src-row.open .src-inner{max-height:200px;padding:15px 22px}.quote{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;border-left:2px solid var(--amber);padding-left:14px}.src-meta{margin-top:6px;color:var(--faint);font-size:11.5px}.split{padding:24px 26px}.split-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:36px}.barblock h3{margin:0;font-size:15px}.bar-sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin:4px 0 18px}.ratio{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--faint)}.bar{height:8px;margin:7px 0 16px;background:var(--line2);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}.bar span{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--green);border-radius:8px}.signal-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.signal-list li{position:relative;padding:6px 0 6px 17px;font-size:13px}.signal-list li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:13px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--faint)}.signal-list li.achieved:before,.signal-list li.reaffirmed:before{background:var(--green)}.signal-list li.tracking:before,.signal-list li.unresolved:before{background:var(--amber)}.signal-list li.missed:before{background:var(--red)}.signal-list li.revised:before{background:var(--blue)}.takeaway{margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted)}.watch{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.wcard{border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:3px solid var(--amber);border-radius:8px;padding:19px 20px;background:var(--card)}.wtop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px}.wname{font-size:17px;font-weight:600}.wdesc{margin:9px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.wfoot{display:flex;gap:18px;color:var(--faint);font-size:11.5px}.foot{margin-top:46px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--faint);font-size:12.5px}.foot strong{color:var(--muted)}
    .signal-list li.signal-achieved:before,.signal-list li.signal-reaffirmed:before{background:var(--green)}.signal-list li.signal-tracking:before,.signal-list li.signal-unresolved:before{background:var(--amber)}.signal-list li.signal-missed:before{background:var(--red)}.signal-list li.signal-revised:before{background:var(--blue)}
    @media(max-width:820px){.wrap{padding:24px 20px 48px}.title{font-size:28px}.trio,.split-grid,.watch{grid-template-columns:1fr}.stat{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.sec-head{display:block}.sec-note{text-align:left;margin-top:4px}.qci-signal-count{position:relative;right:auto;top:auto;text-align:left;margin:14px 0}.qci-table{min-width:760px}.qci-body{overflow-x:auto}.qci-edge{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wfoot{display:block}.score-desc{font-size:12.5px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body><main class="wrap">
  <header class="top"><div><div class="lens-row"><span class="eyebrow">Management lens</span><span class="pill {{ratingClass overall_rating.pill}}">{{overall_rating.label}}</span></div><h1 class="title serif">Guidance Credibility</h1></div><button class="xbtn" aria-label="Close">&times;</button></header>
  {{#if score_badge}}
  <section class="score-badge"><div class="score-ring"><svg width="72" height="72" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="36" cy="36" r="30" fill="none" stroke="#f0efeb" stroke-width="7"/><circle cx="36" cy="36" r="30" fill="none" stroke="{{statusHex score_badge.status_color}}" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="188.5" stroke-dashoffset="{{scoreOffset score_badge.score}}" transform="rotate(-90 36 36)"/></svg><span class="score-num c-{{lower score_badge.status_color}}">{{score_badge.score}}</span></div><div><div class="score-label c-{{lower score_badge.status_color}}">{{score_badge.label}}</div><div class="score-desc">{{score_badge.desc}}</div></div></section>
  {{/if}}
  {{#if headline.length}}<section class="sec"><div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-title">Headline insights</div><div class="sec-note">How management communicates future commitments — and how well available evidence supports subsequent execution.</div></div><div class="trio" style="--count:{{headline.length}}">{{#each headline}}<article class="stat"><div class="lab"><span class="dot {{dot}}"></span>{{label}}</div><div class="big {{value_color}}">{{value}}</div><div class="desc">{{desc}}</div></article>{{/each}}</div></section>{{/if}}
  {{#if narrative.themes.length}}<section class="qci-section"><div class="qci-header"><div class="qci-signal-count">{{narrative.signals_parsed}}<small>signals parsed</small></div><div class="qci-badge"><i class="qci-badge-dot"></i>QC Intuition · Pattern Recognition</div><div class="qci-header-title">How management communicates future commitments.</div><div class="qci-header-sub">Recurring <strong>future commitments, execution updates and disclosure patterns</strong> extracted from Annual Reports and Management Presentations across <strong>{{narrative.period_start}} &rarr; {{narrative.period_end}}</strong>, highlighting how management communicates, updates and follows through on long-term commitments.</div></div><div class="qci-body"><table class="qci-table"><thead><tr><th style="width:220px">Commitment Pattern</th><th>Pattern evolution {{narrative.period_start}} &rarr; {{narrative.period_end}}</th><th>Status</th><th>What it means</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each narrative.themes}}<tr><td><div class="theme-name">{{name}}</div><div class="theme-sub">{{sub}}</div></td><td>{{#if spark}}<svg class="spark" viewBox="0 0 110 46" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="{{spark}}" fill="none" stroke="{{trendHex trend}}" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="{{sparkEndX spark}}" cy="{{sparkEndY spark}}" r="3.5" fill="{{trendHex trend}}"/></svg>{{/if}}</td><td><span class="qci-status-pill {{lower trend}}">{{trendGlyph trend}} {{trend}}</span></td><td>{{{bold interp}}}</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div>
  {{#if narrative.sources.length}}<div class="qci-sources"><strong>Signals from</strong>{{#each narrative.sources}}<span class="qci-src-pill">{{#if count}}{{count}} {{/if}}{{label}}</span>{{/each}}<span class="qci-src-pill">{{narrative.period_start}} &rarr; {{narrative.period_end}}</span></div>{{/if}}
  {{#if narrative.edge}}<div class="qci-edge"><div class="qci-edge-label">The Edge</div><div class="qci-edge-text">{{#if narrative.edge.core_pattern}}<p><strong>Core pattern:</strong> <span class="hl">{{narrative.edge.core_pattern}}</span></p>{{/if}}{{#if narrative.edge.core_behaviour}}<p><strong>Core behaviour:</strong> <span class="hl">{{narrative.edge.core_behaviour}}</span></p>{{/if}}{{#if narrative.edge.credibility_implication}}<p><strong>Credibility implication:</strong> <span class="hl2">{{narrative.edge.credibility_implication}}</span></p>{{/if}}{{#if narrative.edge.key_watch_item}}<p><strong>Key watch item:</strong> <span class="hl3">{{narrative.edge.key_watch_item}}</span></p>{{/if}}{{#if narrative.edge.investor_focus}}<p><strong>Investor focus:</strong> <span class="hl3">{{narrative.edge.investor_focus.theme}}</span>{{#if narrative.edge.investor_focus.reason}} — {{narrative.edge.investor_focus.reason}}{{/if}}</p>{{/if}}{{#if narrative.edge.supporting_metric}}<p><strong>Supporting metric:</strong> <span class="pct">{{narrative.edge.supporting_metric}}</span></p>{{/if}}{{#if narrative.edge.closing_line}}<p>{{narrative.edge.closing_line}}</p>{{/if}}</div></div>{{/if}}</section>{{/if}}
  {{#if credibility_timeline.length}}<section class="sec"><div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-title">Guidance Credibility Over Time</div><div class="sec-note">How the evidence supporting management's guidance execution and accountability has evolved over time. Recent reporting periods carry greater weight.</div></div><div class="scatter"><div class="chart-scroll"><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 1080 220" role="img" aria-label="Guidance credibility timeline {{narrative.period_start}} → {{narrative.period_end}}"><line x1="145" y1="170" x2="1040" y2="170" stroke="#e2e1dd"/><line x1="145" y1="70" x2="1040" y2="70" stroke="#f0efeb" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><line x1="145" y1="115" x2="1040" y2="115" stroke="#f0efeb" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/><g fill="#9a9a96" font-family="Inter" font-size="11"><text x="10" y="60">High Credibility</text><text x="10" y="112">Developing</text><text x="10" y="172">Lower Credibility</text></g><polyline points="{{timelinePoints credibility_timeline}}" fill="none" stroke="#cbc9c2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>{{#each credibility_timeline}}<g><title>{{label}}</title>{{#if (eq credibility "insufficient")}}<circle cx="{{timelineX @index ../credibility_timeline.length}}" cy="{{markerY credibility}}" r="{{markerRadius confidence}}" fill="none" stroke="#9a9a96" stroke-width="2"/>{{else}}<circle cx="{{timelineX @index ../credibility_timeline.length}}" cy="{{markerY credibility}}" r="{{markerRadius confidence}}" fill="{{credibilityHex credibility}}"/>{{/if}}<text x="{{timelineX @index ../credibility_timeline.length}}" y="200" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6c6c68" font-family="Inter" font-size="10">{{period}}</text></g>{{/each}}</svg></div><div class="legend"><span><b style="color:var(--green)">●</b> High Credibility</span><span><b style="color:var(--amber)">●</b> Mixed / Developing Credibility</span><span><b style="color:var(--red)">●</b> Lower Credibility</span><span><b>○</b> Insufficient Evidence</span><span>Marker size represents confidence in the assessment, not company performance.</span></div></div></section>{{/if}}
  {{#with (timelineRows this)}}{{#if length}}<section class="sec"><div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-title">Guidance Evidence Timeline</div><div class="sec-note">How disclosed guidance evolved over time through targets, milestones, revisions and subsequent updates.</div></div><div class="tbl-card"><table class="tbl"><thead><tr><th style="width:80px">Period</th><th>Guidance Item</th><th>Latest Evidence</th><th>Outcome</th><th>Evidence Type</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each this}}<tr><td>{{period}}</td><td class="metric {{effectClass this}}"><div class="m-name">{{topic}}</div><div class="m-desc">{{description}}</div>{{#if source}}<button class="src-btn" onclick="toggleSrc(this,{{@index}})">&#9656; Source quote</button>{{/if}}</td><td>{{evidenceText this}}</td><td>{{outcome}}</td><td>{{evidenceType this}}</td><td><span class="pill {{statusClass status}}">{{status}}</span></td></tr>{{#if source}}<tr class="src-row" id="src-{{@index}}"><td colspan="6"><div class="src-inner">{{#if source.quote}}<div class="quote">&ldquo;{{source.quote}}&rdquo;</div>{{/if}}{{#if source.meta}}<div class="src-meta">{{source.meta}}</div>{{/if}}</div></td></tr>{{/if}}{{/each}}</tbody></table></div></section>{{/if}}{{/with}}
  {{#if split}}<section class="sec"><div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-title">Guidance Credibility by Controllability</div><div class="sec-note">Where does management's guidance prove most reliable? Separate execution-driven commitments from those that depend on market demand.</div></div><div class="split"><div class="split-grid">{{#eachBucket split}}<div class="barblock"><h3>{{title}}</h3><div class="bar-sub">{{sub}}</div><div class="ratio"><span>Credible guidance ratio</span><strong>{{credible}} / {{total}}</strong></div><div class="bar"><span style="width:{{ratioPercent credible total}}%"></span></div><ul class="signal-list">{{#each items}}<li class="signal-{{statusClass status}}">{{text}}</li>{{/each}}</ul></div>{{/eachBucket}}</div>{{#if split.takeaway}}<div class="takeaway">{{{bold split.takeaway}}}</div>{{/if}}</div></section>{{/if}}
  {{#if watchpoints.length}}<section class="sec"><div class="sec-head"><div class="sec-title">Open promises · watch next</div><div class="sec-note">Live commitments that resolve in upcoming results — the reason to come back.</div></div><div class="watch">{{#each watchpoints}}<article class="wcard"><div class="wtop"><div class="wname">{{name}}</div><span class="pill track">Tracking</span></div><div class="wdesc">{{desc}}</div><div class="wfoot"><span>Resolves: <strong>{{resolves}}</strong></span><span>Type: <strong>{{typeLabel type}}</strong></span></div></article>{{/each}}</div></section>{{/if}}
  <footer class="foot"><strong>How this score is built.</strong> — each forward statement paired to its resolved actual and graded beat/in-line/miss; misses weighted by magnitude and recency (last 8 quarters higher), split by controllable vs market-dependent; every row links to source.{{#if footer.computed_date}} Computed {{footer.computed_date}}.{{/if}}{{#if footer.sources}} {{footer.sources}}{{/if}}</footer>
</main><script>function toggleSrc(btn,id){var row=document.getElementById('src-'+id);var open=row.classList.toggle('open');btn.innerHTML=(open?'▾ Source quote':'▸ Source quote')}</script></body></html>
